      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This magic thimble helps thieves foil traps. While you wear it, if you set off a trap and take damage, the thimble takes the damage instead.</p><p>The thimble has 30 Hit Points. If it drops to 0 Hit Points, it breaks, and you take any remaining damage.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-nx47ZTM0SanHCuH9\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Les 30 points de vie du dé à coudre sont ceux de l’objet (onglet Détails).</p></section>",
